   The resonance parameter evaluation was done by Leal,           9222 1451  134
Derrien, Guber, Larson, Wright and Spencer [LE01] using the       9222 1451  135
multilevel R-matrix analysis code SAMMY [LA96].  The resolved     9222 1451  136
resonance evaluation were performed in the energy range from 0 to 9222 1451  137
600 eV. The unresolved resonance region evaluation covers the     9222 1451  138
energy range from 600 eV to 40 keV.                               9222 1451  139
   The evaluation included high resolution transmission data      9222 1451  140
(GU00), fission cross section data [GU98] measured at the Oak     9222 1451  141
Ridge Electron Linear Accelerator (ORELA), in addition to other   9222 1451  142
experimental data.  Integral data were also included in the       9222 1451  143
evaluation. Integral quantities and thermal values calculated     9222 1451  144
with the U-233 resonance parameter are shown in the Table below.  9222 1451  145
Also shown are the results of calculations using U-233 ENDF/B-VI  9222 1451  146
evaluation and Axton standard values:                             9222 1451  147
