>> MF=4 ANGULAR DISTRIBUTIONS OF SECONDARY PARTICLES              9222 1451  364
                                                                  9222 1451  365
MT=2: NEUTRON ELASTIC SCATTERING ANGULAR DISTRIBUTIONS            9222 1451  366
  All elastic neutron angular distributions are based on the      9222 1451  367
coupled-channels optical model calculations with the ECIS96 code  9222 1451  368
(Ra94), including compound elastic contributions.  The optical    9222 1451  369
model results are in good agreement with the experimental data of 9222 1451  370
Ha82.                                                             9222 1451  371
                                                                  9222 1451  372
MT=51-53,55,58,65: DISCRETE INELASTIC NEUTRON ANGULAR             9222 1451  373
                   DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE GROUND-STATE ROTATIONAL  9222 1451  374
                   BAND                                           9222 1451  375
   Angular distributions of the ground-state rotational band are  9222 1451  376
based on coupled-channels optical model calculations with the     9222 1451  377
ECIS96 code, described above, including direct and compound       9222 1451  378
elastic contributions.                                            9222 1451  379
                                                                  9222 1451  380
MT=54,56-57,59-64,66-88: DISCRETE INELASTIC NEUTRON ANGULAR       9222 1451  381
                         DISTRIBUTIONS                            9222 1451  382
   These angular distributions are based on compound-nucleus      9222 1451  383
calculations with ECIS96. In addition, ECIS96 was used for        9222 1451  384
vibrational model calculations for 3- and 2+ states in 238U which 9222 1451  385
were then included in lumped form in the 233U analysis for MT=84- 9222 1451  386
88.                                                               9222 1451  387
                                                                  9222 1451  388
