MT=4: PHOTON MULTIPLICITIES FROM INELASTIC SCATTERING             9222 1451  461
 All data are carried over from ENDF/B-VI, as follows: Transition 9222 1451  462
probabilities are used for four discrete levels assuming 60% -    9222 1451  463
40% split.  Continuum added above 300 keV. Due to the fact that   9222 1451  464
only four levels are involved, the continuum probability is       9222 1451  465
large.  The multiplicities are zero above 1.09 MeV.               9222 1451  466
                                                                  9222 1451  467
