>>> MF=33 RESONANCE PARAMETER COVARIANCE (ORNL)                   9222 1451  509
                                                                  9222 1451  510
Resonance parameter covariances were generated in the resolved    9222 1451  511
energy region (1.0-5 eV to 600.0 eV)                              9222 1451  512
with the computer code SAMMY at ORNL.                             9222 1451  513
Uncertainty on nubar was also generated at ORNL. Experimental     9222 1451  514
data and uncertainties were used to generate covariance data.     9222 1451  515
SAMMY covariance information was converted in the ENDF FILE32     9222 1451  516
representation. However, because of computer storage concern the  9222 1451  517
FILE32 was converted into the FILE33 (MT=1, 2, 18, and 102)       9222 1451  518
representation with reduced computer storage but approximating    9222 1451  519
the features of the FILE32 representation. The full FILE32        9222 1451  520
matrices can be obtained directly from ORNL. The conversion was   9222 1451  521
done with the PUFF-IV code. Above the unresolved resonance region 9222 1451  522
( > 40 keV) covariance data were generated at LANL.               9222 1451  523
                                                                  9222 1451  524
>>> MF=33 FAST-ENERGY COVARIANCE (LANL)                           9222 1451  525
                                                                  9222 1451  526
Cross-section covariance matrices in the fast energy region were  9222 1451  527
obtained through a combination of nuclear reaction sensitivity    9222 1451  528
calculations using the GNASH code, and available information on   9222 1451  529
experimental uncertainties for some of the cross sections. The    9222 1451  530
sensitivity of GNASH results on the choice of model parameters    9222 1451  531
was assessed, and the KALMAN code (Ka97) was used to merge        9222 1451  532
sensitivity calculations with experimental uncertainties.         9222 1451  533
                                                                  9222 1451  534
More details on this work can be found in (Ta08).                 9222 1451  535
                                                                  9222 1451  536
